<title>USA: PaineWebber chemical analyst returns.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber chemical analyst returns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Group Inc said Andrew Cash has rejoined the firm as chemical research analyst.</p>
<p>Cash was most recently at NatWest Securities, a unit of National Westminster Bank Plc. He had covered the chemical industry for four years for PaineWebber prior to joining NatWest.</p>
</text>
